[32m+[m[32m## 1. Project Architecture Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mAutodesk ACC API[m
[32m+[m[32m  │  (3-legged OAuth via APS)[m
[32m+[m[32m  ▼[m
[32m+[m[32mFlask Web App (acc-connector/app.py)[m
[32m+[m[32m  │  ① User authenticates ACC[m
[32m+[m[32m  │  ② User authenticates Databricks[m
[32m+[m[32m  │  ③ 10-step bootstrap (catalog, schema, volume, notebooks, jobs)[m
[32m+[m[32m  │  ④ Sync: ACC fetch → UC Volume JSON → Bronze job → Silver job[m
[32m+[m[32m  ▼[m
[32m+[m[32mDatabricks Workspace (Unity Catalog)[m
[32m+[m[32m  ├── acc_catalog.bronze.issues_raw    (Delta table)[m
[32m+[m[32m  ├── acc_catalog.bronze.rfis_raw      (Delta table)[m
[32m+[m[32m  ├── acc_catalog.bronze.cost_raw      (Delta table)[m
[32m+[m[32m  ├── acc_catalog.silver.issues        (Delta table — deduplicated, typed)[m
[32m+[m[32m  ├── acc_catalog.silver.rfis          (Delta table)[m
[32m+[m[32m  └── acc_catalog.silver.cost          (Delta table)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mState stored in: SQLite (connector.db) — tokens, bootstrap state, sync history[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Data Flow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mStep 3 Sync:[m
[32m+[m[32mACC Issues/RFIs/Cost API[m
[32m+[m[32m   └──(watermark-filtered fetch)──► in-memory JSON[m
[32m+[m[32m                                       └──(Files API PUT)──► UC Volume path[m
[32m+[m[32m                                                               └──► Bronze job (notebook)[m
[32m+[m[32m                                                                       └──► Silver job (notebook)[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
